      "translation": "Chapter 1",
      "translations": [
        "Chapter 1",
        "I love playing with LEGO! My bricks come in lots of colors, shapes, and sizes. My favorite shapes are squares, rectangles, and triangles.",
        "Click! I push two bricks together. So cool! I follow the pictures to build cars, flowers, and little animals. It feels like magic! If my LEGO falls apart, I can build it again.",
        "Chapter 2",
        "I like LEGO games, too. My favorite is LEGO City. I get to explore a whole city made of bricks!"
      ],
